OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FSome clear
OL,6,Fspells developing this evening mainly
OL,7,Facross the north, leading to a cold
OL,8,Fnight here with some pockets of fog
OL,9,Fand frost. Slightly milder under cloud
OL,10,Fin the south. Thicker cloud returns
OL,11,Fmore widely towards dawn.
OL,12,
OL,13,CThursday:FA rather cloudy day for many
OL,14,Fwith some light spots of rain possible
OL,15,Fin the south. Best of any brightness
OL,16,Fto the west of high ground.
OL,17,FTemperatures remaining around average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
