OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FLargely
OL,6,Fcloudy Friday and over the weekend. A
OL,7,Fsmall chance of rain at times,
OL,8,Fespecially later Saturday. Overnight
OL,9,Ffrost or fog patches possible during
OL,10,Fany clearer spells.
